WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.000
<v Priya (Acme)>Currently our helpdesk logs every complaint in a spreadsheet and assigns it by phone.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.000
<v Priya (Acme)>We need the vendor to be able to accept or reject an assigned work order from the vendor portal.

3
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.000
<v Dinesh (Facilio)>Should the supervisor approve the quote before the work starts?

4
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
<v Ahmed (Acme)>Yes, agreed, the supervisor approves every quote above five thousand dirhams.

5
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.000
<v Ahmed (Acme)>Maybe we also need a second approval from finance, we will confirm next week.

6
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.000
<v Priya (Acme)>The Resolution Notes field should be mandatory when the technician resolves the work order.

7
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.000
<v Priya (Acme)>We must integrate the purchase orders with SAP so finance sees them automatically.

8
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.000
<v Ahmed (Acme)>We don't need the Work Permit for small electrical jobs, it should not be required.
